# Kettle Day: Kettle's default light theme.
# Derived from "TokyoNight Day" in the iTerm2-Color-Schemes Ghostty set
# (https://github.com/mbadolato/iTerm2-Color-Schemes, MIT License; see LICENSE
# in this directory). That palette comes from tokyonight.nvim
# (https://github.com/folke/tokyonight.nvim, Apache License 2.0; full text in
# docs/licenses/tokyonight.nvim/LICENSE).
# Changed by Kettle: each text colour is darkened along its own hue (OKLCH
# lightness) until the foreground, cursor and bright white reach 7:1 and ANSI
# slots 1-7 and 9-15 reach 4.5:1 against the background. The background,
# cursor text, selection background and slots 0 and 8 are TokyoNight Day's.
